    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Huge even by the standards of their fearsome kind, abominable yetis are stronger and more bloodthirsty than other yetis. They claim entire regions as hunting grounds and may track intruders for days. When they spot prey, they hurl boulders of ice and snow before closing in for the kill, and besides their frozen claws and gaze they can breathe out a blast of polar cold. They live in icy ruins or in the abandoned lairs of other monsters on top of notorious peaks.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
